      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a60e3832478a072c83fa7ce|full_name}: I should probably clarify. Now is not the time to add this feature so soon after the ranking system has been implemented. after avatars become more optimized by a bigger population of the game this feature would be a great idea, However until avatars that are available to the newer users of this game become more optimized i would say that this feature should not be implemented. Some time in the near future would be better.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
