  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-02-06T22:02:09.034Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Please give an option to automatically \"grey-man\" avatars above a certain performance threshold as an option.\nFor example, I would love to be able to disable all avatars (except friends, IF I choose.) for example above \"good\" or \"medium\" rating. This could be something we can toggle. I feel it would be extremely helpful to not only encourage users to have more optimized avatars handy for large gatherings but to improve performance on the whole for everyone.",
